<view class="container">
  <view class="eyebrow">Mutual crush · experiment</view>
  <view class="title">写下 3 个名字</view>
  <view class="subtitle">若互相写下，信号会亮。不会打扰对方；单方面的心动永远不会展示给另一方。</view>
  <view class="demo-tag">Prototype · Demo Data</view>

  <view class="form">
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">我的名字 *</view>
      <input class="input" value="{{form.name}}" placeholder="例如：小林" bindinput="onUserInput" data-key="name" />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">我的学校 *</view>
      <input class="input" value="{{form.schoolRaw}}" placeholder="例如：实验中学" bindinput="onUserInput" data-key="schoolRaw" />
      <view class="hint">含「实验 / 一中 / 二中 / 外国语」时会给出 2 个 mock 候选；否则创建 pending 学校。</view>
      <view class="action">
        <ui-button type="accent" bindtap="confirmSchool">确认学校</ui-button>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{showCandidates}}" class="hint">请选择你的学校：</view>
      <view
        wx:for="{{candidates}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="candidate {{schoolId === item.id ? 'is-selected' : ''}}"
        bindtap="selectSchool"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
      >{{item.label}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{schoolLabel}}" class="confirmed">已选：{{schoolLabel}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">我的入学年份 *</view>
      <input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.enrollmentYear}}" placeholder="2010" bindinput="onUserInput" data-key="enrollmentYear" />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">城市（可选）</view>
      <input class="input" value="{{form.city}}" placeholder="例如：杭州" bindinput="onUserInput" data-key="city" />
    </view>

    <view class="section-title">心动名单（1–3 个）</view>
    <view class="section-sub">每个至少填写对方名字；学校 / 年份可选。不能按名字搜索谁喜欢你。</view>

    <view wx:for="{{crushes}}" wx:key="index" class="crush-block">
      <view class="block-title">心动 {{index + 1}}</view>
      <view class="field">
        <view class="label">对方名字 *</view>
        <input class="input" value="{{item.targetName}}" placeholder="例如：Ada" bindinput="onCrushInput" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="targetName" />
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <view class="label">对方学校（可选）</view>
        <input class="input" value="{{item.targetSchool}}" placeholder="可选" bindinput="onCrushInput" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="targetSchool" />
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <view class="label">对方入学年份（可选）</view>
        <input class="input" type="number" value="{{item.targetYear}}" placeholder="可选" bindinput="onCrushInput" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="targetYear" />
      </view>
      <ui-button wx:if="{{crushes.length > 1}}" type="ghost" bindtap="removeCrush" data-index="{{index}}">移除这一位</ui-button>
    </view>

    <view class="action" wx:if="{{crushes.length < 3}}">
      <ui-button type="secondary" bindtap="addCrush">再加一个名字</ui-button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="boundary">
    安全边界（实验演示）：不通知被写下的人；不允许「谁喜欢我」式搜索；不公开任何心动名单；无聊天、无支付、无真实分享链路。
  </view>

  <view class="action">
    <ui-button type="accent" bindtap="submit">放进风里</ui-button>
  </view>
</view>
